@startuml Fase4_Estados
hide empty description
[*] --> Preparing
Preparing --> InitialExchange : StartMatch / reparto de 9
InitialExchange --> InitialDeclarations : todas las selecciones / intercambio simultaneo
InitialDeclarations --> Finished : victoria inicial valida
InitialDeclarations --> AwaitingDraw : todos listos
AwaitingDraw --> AwaitingClaims : DrawFromDeck / carta publica
AwaitingDraw --> AwaitingPayment : DrawFromDiscard / uso valido
AwaitingClaims --> AwaitingDraw : nadie reclama / carta al pozo
note on link
Primera oferta sin uso: mismo jugador, segundo robo del mazo.
Las siguientes: jugador habilitado a la derecha del origen.
end note
AwaitingClaims --> AwaitingPayment : reclamo elegido por prioridad
AwaitingClaims --> Finished : victoria declarada valida
AwaitingPayment --> AwaitingClaims : PayCard / pago publico
AwaitingPayment --> AwaitingDraw : mano vacia / continuar sin pago
AwaitingPayment --> Finished : DeclareDesmoche valido
AwaitingDraw --> Finished : no existen fuentes legales
Finished --> Preparing : PrepareNextMatch / rota quien inicia
Finished --> [*]
@enduml

@startuml Fase4_Clases
class GameManager {
  +Phase
  +CurrentPlayerId
  +PaymentPlayerId
  +WinnerPlayerId
  +Result
  +State
  +StartMatch()
  +DrawFromDeck()
  +DrawFromDiscard()
  +SubmitClaim()
  +ResolveClaims()
  +PayCard()
  +DeclareDesmoche()
  +GetViewFor()
}
class GameState {
  +Players
  +Melds
  +OfferedCard
  +DeckCount
  +DiscardCount
  +CreateViewFor()
}
class RulesValidator
class Meld {
  +Id
  +OwnerPlayerId
  +Cards
}
class MeldPlay {
  +MeldId
  +CardIds
}
class Player
class PlayerHand
class Deck
class DiscardPile
class Card
GameManager --> GameState : unico escritor del motor
GameManager --> RulesValidator : valida cartas y victoria
GameManager ..> MeldPlay : solicitudes copiadas
GameState *-- Player
GameState *-- Meld
GameState *-- Deck
GameState *-- DiscardPile
GameState o-- Card : oferta temporal
Player *-- PlayerHand
PlayerHand o-- Card
Meld o-- Card
Deck o-- Card
DiscardPile o-- Card
@enduml
